OL,3,ASnooker champion Graeme Dott jailed for
OL,4,Aseven years for child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,7,FDott has been jailed for seven years
OL,8,Fafter being convicted of child sexual
OL,9,Fabuse.
OL,11,FJudge Lord Harrower said Dott robbed
OL,12,Fhis victims of "a significant part of
OL,13,Ftheir childhood" and said his behaviour
OL,14,Fbore the hallmarks of grooming.
OL,16,FDott had denied two charges of lewd and
OL,17,Flibidinous behaviour towards a girl and
OL,18,Fa boy between 1993 and 2010 but was
OL,19,Ffound guilty following a trial at the
OL,20,FHigh Court in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
