OL,3,ASnooker champion Graeme Dott jailed for
OL,4,Aseven years for child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 49-year-old Scot, who won the world
OL,7,Fsnooker title in 2006, showed no
OL,8,Femotion as he was sentenced, only
OL,9,Fnodding to someone in the public
OL,10,Fgallery as he was led away.
